    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to boring math drills! Use your math skills to defeat monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of a hero and face off against monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer math problems to unleash powerful attacks and take down your enemies one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls, you can improve your accuracy and speed while having fun! Embark on your adventure now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Choose Your Game Mode]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers two modes to suit your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Mode: Practice as much as you want with no game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Mode: Test your accuracy as mistakes lead to damage from monsters in this thrilling mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Customize Your Math Problems]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely mix and match problems from the following categories:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addition (Levels 1, 2, 3)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtraction (Levels 1, 2, 3)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Division</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the math operations you want to practice!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to boring math drills! Use your math skills to defeat monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of a hero and face off against monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer math problems to unleash powerful attacks and take down your enemies one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls, you can improve your accuracy and speed while having fun! Embark on your adventure now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Choose Your Game Mode]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers two modes to suit your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Mode: Practice as much as you want with no game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Mode: Test your accuracy as mistakes lead to damage from monsters in this thrilling mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Customize Your Math Problems]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely mix and match problems from the following categories:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addition (Levels 1, 2, 3)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtraction (Levels 1, 2, 3)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Division</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the math operations you want to practice!</p>",
